<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task importance="optional" id="t00193">
	<title id="e01221">Rear windshield wiper and washer operation </title>
	<shortdesc>The rear windshield wiper and washer switch is located at the end of the lever.</shortdesc>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>wipers and washers
					<indexterm>rear windshield wiper and washer operation</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<taskbody>
		<steps-unordered id="e01222">
			<step>
				<cmd>To operate the rear wiper and washer, turn the switch to the desired position.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01223">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e01224">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_B05_016.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
				<choices id="e01225">
					<choice>
						<p><uicontrol>HI/2</uicontrol>: Normal wiper operation</p>
					</choice>
					<choice>
						<p><uicontrol>LO/1</uicontrol>: Intermittent wiper operation</p>
					</choice>
					<choice>
						<p><uicontrol>OFF/0</uicontrol>: Wiper is not in operation</p>
					</choice>
				</choices>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Push the lever away from you to spray rear washer fluid and to run the rear wipers several times.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01226">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e01227">
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP327_B05_017.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
				<stepresult>
					<p>The spray and wiper operation will continue until you release the lever.</p>
					<p>When you activate the front wiper and shift to R (Reverse), the rear wiper will activate once to provide better visibility.</p>
					<p>The rear wiper operates while the vehicle is in R (Reverse) with the front wiper on.</p>
					<p>Select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Convenience</uicontrol><uicontrol>Auto Rear Wiper (in R)</uicontrol></menucascade> from the infotainment system.</p>
				</stepresult>
			</step>
		</steps-unordered>
	</taskbody>
